Amulet of magical breathing.  If you don't have one, collect all the
amulets you can and start polypiling for one.  Otherwise if you can
poly yourself, become a non-air breather and you can grab the bag
yourself.  Either way is tricky if you don't already have the means.
But, I have found that once you have the amulet the bag of loot only
contains niceties, not necessities.  You can probably survive without
most of what was in there.

Good luck!  If you get through this one you've earned it.



